### Creare utilizator
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria",
  "email": "maria@example.com",
  "password": "parola456"
}

### Autentificare cu utilizatorul de test
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria@example.com",
  "password": "parola456"
}

> {% client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Creare teren
POST http://localhost:8080/api/fields
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teren Central",
  "sport": "baschet",
  "address": "Strada Principala 10",
  "latitude": 44.4268,
  "longitude": 26.1025
}

### Creare meci
POST http://localhost:8080/api/matches
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "sport": "baschet",
  "startTime": "2026-11-15T18:00:00",
  "maxPlayers": 10,
  "playersNeeded": 4,
  "field": {
    "id": 1
  }
}

### Afisare meciuri
GET http://localhost:8080/api/matches

### Modificare meci
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/matches/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "sport": "baschet",
  "startTime": "2026-12-10T19:30:00",
  "maxPlayers": 12,
  "playersNeeded": 6,
  "fieldId": 1
}

### Filtrare meciuri
GET http://localhost:8080/api/matches/sport/baschet

### Afisare terenuri
GET http://localhost:8080/api/fields

### Filtrare dupa sport
GET http://localhost:8080/api/fields/sport/baschet


### Afisare utilizatori
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users

### Inscriere utilizator la meci
POST http://localhost:8080/api/matches/1/participants/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Afisare participanti
GET http://localhost:8080/api/matches/1/participants

### Anulare inscriere la meci
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/matches/1/participants/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Verificare locuri disponibile la meci
GET http://localhost:8080/api/matches/1/availability

### Stergere meci si inscrierile aferente
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/matches/{{matchIdToDelete}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
